<title>HONG KONG: HK weather - cloudy, bright periods, max 25 C.</title>
<headline>HK weather - cloudy, bright periods, max 25 C.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>It will be cloudy but with bright periods during the day, the Royal Observatory said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The maximum temperature will reach 25 C.</p>
<p>At 7 a.m. the temperature was 22 C and the relative humidity 78 per cent.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843-6369</p>
